title: "robo-cortex: Git-anchored Evidence-based Agent Memory"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-26
url: "https://github.com/robotel-limited/robo-cortex"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol (MCP) implementation built on the premise that
  machine memory is only as trustworthy as the code it points at.
  Features git-anchored memories and evidence-based confidence scoring.
keywords:
  - mcp
  - ai-memory
  - context-protocol
